OL,3,AArrests made in Mohamed Al Fayed probe
OL,4,Ain France, police say
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrench police have made arrests after
OL,7,Fthree properties, including the Ritz
OL,8,Fhotel in Paris, were searched in
OL,9,Frelation to an investigation into
OL,10,FMohamed Al Fayed's abuse.
OL,12,FIn a confidential letter sent to
OL,13,Fsurvivors, the Metropolitan Police
OL,14,Fconfirmed that on 13 and 14 October,
OL,15,FFrench police searched three properties
OL,16,Fwhich resulted in a "number of
OL,17,Farrests".
OL,19,FMet officers were present in what is
OL,20,Funderstood to be a joint operation
OL,21,Fbetween British and French authorities.
OL,23,APub: 10-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,309,300,200,140,0,100
